  "description": "XImage.QRCode is a C# QR Code generator and reader library to generate, read QR Code in C#.NET projects.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Steyled QR Code, +GS1)\n\nOutput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg, tiff\n* Vector images: svg, eps\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\nOnline Guides :\n* C# Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/barcode-generating-qrcode-how-to/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
